    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A research study funded by the Higher Education Commission of Pakistan commenced at AKU-IED to  study the social capabilities and life skills of secondary school students in Sindh, Gilgit-Baltistan and Chitral. The study will involve 2,500 respondents from 60 schools in the three regions over a period of three years.",
